<h1 style="font-size:24px; font-weight:700; color:#222; margin-bottom:16px;">
  Invitation to Join FoodMatrix
</h1>

<p style="font-size:15px; color:#444; line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:12px;">
  Hi
  {{inviteeName}},
</p>

<p style="font-size:15px; color:#444; line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:24px;">
  <strong>{{inviterName}}</strong>
  has invited you to join the
  <strong>{{accountName}}</strong>
  account on
  <strong>FoodMatrix</strong>. Join now to collaborate on meal planning, health
  tracking, and smart budgeting together.
</p>

<a
  href="{{acceptLink}}"
  style="
    display:inline-block;
    background:#2ecc71;
    padding:14px 28px;
    color:#ffffff;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-size:16px;
    font-weight:600;
    margin:16px 0;
  "
>
  Accept Invitation
</a>

<p style="font-size:14px; color:#666; line-height:1.6; margin-top:24px;">
  This invitation will expire in 7 days.
</p>

<p style="font-size:14px; color:#666; line-height:1.6; margin-top:8px;">
  If you were not expecting this invitation, you may safely ignore this email.
</p>